<div id="tab_plugin_lazarus" class="tab-pane">
    <div class="container-fluid lazarus-ui">
        <div class="lazarus-hero">
            <div class="lazarus-title-stack">
                <h3 class="lazarus-title">Failed Print Resume Wizard</h3>
                <p class="lazarus-slogan">Save Time, Save $$$ , Save that Print!</p>
                <p class="lazarus-tagline">
                    <em>Powered by Lazarus, the only patent pending method that realigns and resumes an incomplete print easily, safely, accurately, and in seconds! .... all rights reserved</em>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lazarus-nav-row">
            <div class="lazarus-nav-left">
                <button class="btn lazarus-nav-btn"
                        type="button"
                        data-bind="click: openActivationPage"
                        title="Open activation and pricing in your browser.">
                    Pricing / Activation
                </button>

                <button class="btn lazarus-nav-btn"
                        type="button"
                        data-toggle="modal"
                        data-target="#howto-modal"
                        title="Open a quick workflow guide.">
                    How It Works
                </button>

                <button class="btn lazarus-nav-btn"
                        type="button"
                        data-toggle="modal"
                        data-target="#contact-modal"
                        title="Open support details.">
                    Contact
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="lazarus-nav-right">
                <span class="label label-success"
                      data-bind="visible: licenseValid()">
                    License Valid
                </span>

                <span class="label label-important"
                      data-bind="visible: !licenseValid()">
                    License Required
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lazarus-help-text"
             data-bind="visible: !licenseValid()">
            Pricing and activation happen on the Failed Print Resume Wizard website, outside OctoPrint.
        </div>

        <div class="lazarus-card lazarus-license-card">
            <div class="lazarus-stage-header">
                <div>
                    <div class="lazarus-standard-label">License</div>
                    <h4>Activate This OctoPrint Install</h4>
                </div>

                <div class="lazarus-license-status">
                    <span class="label label-success"
                          data-bind="visible: licenseValid()">
                        Active
                    </span>
                    <span class="label label-important"
                          data-bind="visible: !licenseValid()">
                        Required
                    </span>
                    <span data-bind="text: licenseDeviceSummary"></span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="lazarus-help-text" data-bind="text: licenseStatusText"></div>

            <div class="row-fluid lazarus-license-grid">
                <div class="span4">
                    <label>Install ID</label>
                    <input type="text"
                           class="input-block-level lazarus-input"
                           readonly
                           data-bind="value: installId">
                </div>

                <div class="span4">
                    <label>Checkout Email</label>
                    <input type="email"
                           class="input-block-level lazarus-input"
                           placeholder="you@example.com"
                           data-bind="value: licenseEmail, valueUpdate: 'afterkeydown'">
                </div>

                <div class="span4">
                    <label>License Key</label>
                    <input type="text"
                           class="input-block-level lazarus-input"
                           placeholder="Paste license key"
                           data-bind="value: licenseKey, valueUpdate: 'afterkeydown'">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="lazarus-license-actions">
                <button class="btn lazarus-function-btn"
                        type="button"
                        data-bind="click: recoverLicenseKey, enable: !licenseBusy()"
                        title="Use the checkout email and this install ID to look up the license key.">
                    Find License Key
                </button>

                <button class="btn lazarus-action-btn"
                        type="button"
                        data-bind="click: activateLicense, enable: !licenseBusy()"
                        title="Activate this OctoPrint install with your subscription license.">
                    Activate This Device
                </button>

                <button class="btn lazarus-function-btn"
                        type="button"
                        data-bind="click: openActivationPage"
                        title="Open checkout and account activation in a browser.">
                    Open Checkout
                </button>

                <button class="btn lazarus-function-btn"
                        type="button"
                        data-bind="click: deactivateDevice, enable: licenseValid() && !licenseBusy()"
                        title="Remove this OctoPrint install from the active license device list.">
                    Deactivate This Device
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lazarus-card lazarus-mode-card">
            <div class="lazarus-mode-copy">
                <div class="lazarus-standard-label">Printer Control Mode</div>
                <h4>Motion Command Path</h4>
                <p class="lazarus-help-text">
                    Use standard OctoPrint motion commands, or switch to Moonraker / Klipper mode for printers controlled through Moonraker.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="lazarus-mode-controls">
                <button class="btn lazarus-toggle-btn"
                        type="button"
                        data-bind="click: toggleControlMode, css: { 'is-enabled': moonrakerMode() }"
                        title="Switch between OctoPrint mode and Moonraker / Klipper mode.">
                    Moonraker / Klipper:
                    <span class="lazarus-mode-state"
                          data-bind="text: moonrakerModeLabel, css: { 'is-enabled': moonrakerMode() }"></span>
                </button>

                <button class="btn lazarus-moonraker-test-btn"
                        type="button"
                        data-bind="click: testMoonraker, visible: moonrakerMode"
                        title="Verify that Moonraker and Klippy are reachable.">
                    Test Connection
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lazarus-card">
            <div class="lazarus-inputs-head">
                <h4>Source File</h4>

                <div class="lazarus-file-selector">
                    <div class="lazarus-file-selector-label">Selected file</div>

                    <div class="lazarus-file-selected"
                         data-bind="text: selectedFileLabel"
                         title="Currently selected G-code source."></div>

                    <div class="lazarus-file-selector-controls">
                        <select class="input-block-level lazarus-input"
                                data-bind="
                                    options: availableFiles,
                                    optionsText: 'label',
                                    optionsValue: 'path',
                                    value: selectedServerFilePath,
                                    optionsCaption: 'Choose OctoPrint file',
                                    event: { change: selectServerFile }
                                "
                                title="Choose a G-code file from OctoPrint local storage."></select>

                        <button class="btn lazarus-function-btn lazarus-file-picker-btn"
                                type="button"
                                data-bind="click: openLocalFilePicker"
                                title="Choose a G-code file from this device.">
                            Choose From Device
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="lazarus-file-dropzone"
                         data-bind="css: { 'is-dragging': isDraggingFile() }"
                         title="Drag and drop a G-code file here.">
                        Drag and drop a `.gcode` file here
                    </div>

                    <input id="lazarus-local-file-input"
                           type="file"
                           accept=".gcode,.gco,.gc,.g"
                           class="lazarus-hidden-file-input">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="lazarus-print-state">
                <div>
                    <div class="lazarus-standard-label">Print state</div>
                    <div class="lazarus-help-text">
                        Choose Loose From Bed when the failed part must be glued back onto a freshly printed landing pad.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="lazarus-print-state-controls">
                    <button class="btn lazarus-toggle-btn"
                            type="button"
                            data-bind="click: function () { setPrintState('stuck'); }, css: { 'is-enabled': !looseFromBed() }"
                            title="Use the normal resume workflow for a print still attached to the build plate.">
                        Stuck To Bed
                    </button>

                    <button class="btn lazarus-toggle-btn"
                            type="button"
                            data-bind="click: function () { setPrintState('loose'); }, css: { 'is-enabled': looseFromBed() }"
                            title="Print a landing pad first, then glue the failed part into place.">
                        Loose From Bed
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="lazarus-loose-bed-flow" data-bind="visible: looseFromBed()">
                <div class="lazarus-experimental-badge">Experimental</div>

                <label class="checkbox lazarus-checkbox">
                    <input type="checkbox"
                           data-bind="checked: bedClearConfirmed">
                    Confirm bed is clear before the slicer start sequence and landing pad print.
                </label>

                <label class="checkbox lazarus-checkbox">
                    <input type="checkbox"
                           data-bind="checked: includeLandingPadSupports">
                    Print Landing Pad + optional - Supports
                </label>

                <div class="row-fluid" data-bind="visible: includeLandingPadSupports">
                    <div class="span6">
                        <label>Insertion Clearance (mm)</label>
                        <input type="number"
                               min="0"
                               step="0.1"
                               class="input-block-level lazarus-input"
                               data-bind="value: supportClearance">
                    </div>
                    <div class="span6">
                        <label class="checkbox lazarus-checkbox">
                            <input type="checkbox"
                                   data-bind="checked: includeSupportInterface">
                            Include bed-connected support-interface paths
                        </label>
                    </div>
                    <p class="lazarus-help-text">
                        Tagged-only mode extracts compact support extrusion paths. Model toolpaths are not replayed.
                        Enter the measured loose-print height below before starting.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="lazarus-landing-pad-actions">
                    <button class="btn btn-large lazarus-action-btn"
                            type="button"
                            data-bind="click: buildLandingPad, enable: canBuildLandingPad()"
                            title="Run the selected file's slicer start sequence and first layer as a landing pad.">
                        Show Me Where To Glue It
                    </button>

                    <div class="lazarus-landing-pad-status"
                         data-bind="text: landingPadStatusText"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="lazarus-help-text" data-bind="visible: includeLandingPadSupports">
                    <strong data-bind="text: supportMoveCount"></strong> retained support moves;
                    <strong data-bind="text: rejectedInsertionSupportMoves"></strong> rejected by insertion clearance;
                    <strong data-bind="text: rejectedDisconnectedSupportMoves"></strong> rejected as disconnected.
                    <div data-bind="foreach: supportWarnings">
                        <div class="lazarus-critical-warning" data-bind="text: $data"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <label class="checkbox lazarus-checkbox">
                    <input type="checkbox"
                           data-bind="checked: printGluedInPlace, enable: landingPadBuilt()">
                    The failed print is glued in place on the landing pad.
                </label>
            </div>

            <div class="row-fluid">
                <div class="span6">
                    <label>Measured Print Height (mm)</label>

                    <input type="number"
                           step="0.1"
                           class="input-block-level lazarus-input"
                           placeholder="22.0"
                           data-bind="value: measuredHeight, disable: !canEnterMeasuredHeight()"
                           title="Measure the incomplete print and enter the lower of the two edge measurements.">
                </div>

                <div class="span6">
                    <label>Alignment Side</label>

                    <select class="input-block-level lazarus-input"
                            data-bind="value: alignmentSide"
                            title="Choose the side that measured lower.">
                        <option value="left">Left</option>
                        <option value="right">Right</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="lazarus-help-text">
                Measure the left and right side of the incomplete print and enter the lower value to the nearest 0.1 mm.
                <span data-bind="visible: looseFromBed()">
                    Measure the loose print before building optional supports; after gluing, verify the total height from the bed.
                </span>
            </div>

            <button class="btn btn-large btn-block lazarus-action-btn"
                    data-bind="click: buildResume, enable: canBuildResume()"
                    title="Generate a resume file and the alignment target.">
                Build Resume G-code
            </button>
        </div>

        <div class="lazarus-card" data-bind="visible: buildInProgress() || resumeBuilt()">
            <div class="lazarus-warning-box">
                <div class="lazarus-warning-intro" data-bind="visible: buildInProgress()">
                    Building your resume file. This may take a few seconds.
                </div>

                <p>Use Safe Resume Homing unless you already trust the printer's current coordinates or a saved assumed position.</p>
                <p>After that, move to the true alignment point and use OctoPrint's motion controls to align the nozzle to the chosen edge of the print.</p>
                <p>When the nozzle is aligned, click Position Calibrated to lock coordinates and add a safe Z hop before heating the nozzle.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lazarus-card" data-bind="visible: resumeBuilt()">
            <div class="lazarus-stage-header">
                <h4>Calibration</h4>

                <div class="lazarus-datum-display"
                     title="The target point used for final alignment.">
                    Alignment target coordinates:
                    <span>X=<strong data-bind="text: datumX"></strong></span>
                    <span>Y=<strong data-bind="text: datumY"></strong></span>
                    <span>Z=<strong data-bind="text: datumZ"></strong></span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row-fluid">
                <div class="span6">
                    <button class="btn btn-block lazarus-function-btn"
                            data-bind="click: openSafeResumeHomingPrompt"
                            title="Choose the safest way to establish a starting coordinate state.">
                        1. Safe Resume Homing
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div class="span6">
                    <button class="btn btn-block lazarus-function-btn"
                            data-bind="click: goToDatum"
                            title="Move the toolhead over the alignment target.">
                        2. Move To Alignment Zone
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lazarus-card" data-bind="visible: resumeBuilt()">
            <h4>Resume G-code Preview</h4>

            <pre class="lazarus-preview"
                 data-bind="visible: resumeBuilt(), text: previewText"></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="lazarus-card lazarus-resume-card">
            <label class="checkbox lazarus-checkbox">
                <input type="checkbox"
                       data-bind="checked: motionAcknowledged">
                I have aligned the toolhead, confirmed temperatures, and it is safe to move.
            </label>

            <div class="lazarus-resume-actions">
                <button class="btn btn-large lazarus-download-btn"
                        data-bind="enable: canDownloadResume(), click: downloadResume"
                        title="Download the generated resume G-code.">
                    Download Resume G-code
                </button>

                <button class="btn btn-large lazarus-resume-btn"
                        data-bind="enable: canResume(), click: resumeNow"
                        title="Start the generated resume sequence.">
                    Resume Print
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lazarus-legal-links">
            <a href="https://wizard.lazarus3dprint.com/license" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">License</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">|</span>
            <a href="https://wizard.lazarus3dprint.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Terms</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">|</span>
            <a href="https://wizard.lazarus3dprint.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="safe-resume-homing-modal"
         class="modal hide fade"
         tabindex="-1"
         role="dialog"
         aria-labelledby="safe-resume-homing-modal-label"
         aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-header">
            <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-hidden="true">&times;</button>
            <h3 id="safe-resume-homing-modal-label">Safe Resume Homing</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="modal-body">
            <div class="lazarus-option-stack">
                <label class="checkbox lazarus-checkbox lazarus-expert-option"
                       title="Use this only if your printer still has trustworthy coordinates.">
                    <input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: attestCurrentCoordinates">
                    My printer already has a trustworthy current coordinate state.
                </label>

                <label class="checkbox lazarus-checkbox lazarus-expert-option"
                       title="Use saved assumed position values from Failed Print Resume Wizard settings.">
                    <input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: useAssumedPositionCoordinates">
                    Use saved assumed position coordinates.
                </label>

                <div class="lazarus-datum-display"
                     title="Saved assumed position coordinates from the settings panel.">
                    Saved Assumed Position:
                    <span>X=<strong data-bind="text: parkX"></strong></span>
                    <span>Y=<strong data-bind="text: parkY"></strong></span>
                    <span>Z=<strong data-bind="text: parkZ"></strong></span>
                </div>

                <div class="lazarus-standard-option">
                    <div class="lazarus-standard-label">Default option</div>
                    <p class="lazarus-disclaimer">
                        Best choice for most cartesian and CoreXY printers when you need a reliable starting state.
                    </p>
                    <button class="btn btn-large btn-block lazarus-action-btn"
                            type="button"
                            data-bind="click: applySafeResumeHoming"
                            title="Set a temporary Z and home X and Y.">
                        Run Safe Resume Homing
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="modal-footer">
            <button class="btn" type="button" data-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="alignment-step-modal"
         class="modal hide fade"
         tabindex="-1"
         role="dialog"
         aria-labelledby="alignment-step-modal-label"
         aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-header">
            <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-hidden="true">&times;</button>
            <h3 id="alignment-step-modal-label">Precision Alignment</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="modal-body">
            <p class="lazarus-critical-warning">
                <strong>Important:</strong> Do not use Z-offset tools for this step. Use normal motion controls and align the nozzle to the selected edge of the print with paper-test clearance.
            </p>

            <div class="lazarus-precision-controls" data-bind="visible: moonrakerMode">
                <div class="lazarus-control-block">
                    <div class="lazarus-control-head">
                        <h4>X / Y Alignment</h4>
                        <div class="lazarus-step-chooser">
                            <button class="btn lazarus-chip"
                                    type="button"
                                    data-bind="click: function () { setXyJogStep(10); }, css: { 'is-active': xyJogStep() === 10 }">
                                10 mm
                            </button>
                            <button class="btn lazarus-chip"
                                    type="button"
                                    data-bind="click: function () { setXyJogStep(1); }, css: { 'is-active': xyJogStep() === 1 }">
                                1 mm
                            </button>
                            <button class="btn lazarus-chip"
                                    type="button"
                                    data-bind="click: function () { setXyJogStep(0.1); }, css: { 'is-active': xyJogStep() === 0.1 }">
                                0.1 mm
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="lazarus-jog-grid">
                        <button class="btn lazarus-function-btn"
                                type="button"
                                data-bind="click: function () { jogAxis('y', xyJogStep()); }">
                            Y+
                        </button>

                        <div class="lazarus-jog-row">
                            <button class="btn lazarus-function-btn"
                                    type="button"
                                    data-bind="click: function () { jogAxis('x', -xyJogStep()); }">
                                X-
                            </button>
                            <button class="btn lazarus-function-btn"
                                    type="button"
                                    data-bind="click: function () { jogAxis('x', xyJogStep()); }">
                                X+
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <button class="btn lazarus-function-btn"
                                type="button"
                                data-bind="click: function () { jogAxis('y', -xyJogStep()); }">
                            Y-
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="lazarus-control-block">
                    <div class="lazarus-control-head">
                        <h4>Z Alignment</h4>
                        <div class="lazarus-step-chooser">
                            <button class="btn lazarus-chip"
                                    type="button"
                                    data-bind="click: function () { setZJogStep(1); }, css: { 'is-active': zJogStep() === 1 }">
                                1 mm
                            </button>
                            <button class="btn lazarus-chip"
                                    type="button"
                                    data-bind="click: function () { setZJogStep(0.1); }, css: { 'is-active': zJogStep() === 0.1 }">
                                0.1 mm
                            </button>
                            <button class="btn lazarus-chip"
                                    type="button"
                                    data-bind="click: function () { setZJogStep(0.05); }, css: { 'is-active': zJogStep() === 0.05 }">
                                0.05 mm
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="lazarus-jog-row lazarus-jog-row-centered">
                        <button class="btn lazarus-function-btn"
                                type="button"
                                data-bind="click: function () { jogAxis('z', zJogStep()); }">
                            Z+
                        </button>
                        <button class="btn lazarus-function-btn"
                                type="button"
                                data-bind="click: function () { jogAxis('z', -zJogStep()); }">
                            Z-
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="lazarus-failsafe-row">
                <button class="btn lazarus-failsafe-btn"
                        type="button"
                        data-bind="click: resetAlignmentZ"
                        title="Reset the temporary Z coordinate if you need more room to align safely.">
                    Need more room to align Z?
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="lazarus-calibrated-action">
                <p class="lazarus-disclaimer">When X, Y, and Z are aligned to the print, lock the position and add a safe Z hop.</p>
                <button class="btn btn-large btn-block lazarus-action-btn"
                        type="button"
                        data-bind="click: lockDatum"
                        title="Lock the calibrated position and raise Z by the configured safe hop.">
                    Position Calibrated
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="modal-footer">
            <button class="btn" type="button" data-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="howto-modal"
         class="modal hide fade"
         tabindex="-1"
         role="dialog"
         aria-labelledby="howto-modal-label"
         aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-header">
            <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-hidden="true">&times;</button>
            <h3 id="howto-modal-label">How It Works</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="modal-body">
            <p><strong>Failed Print Resume Wizard</strong></p>
            <p>1. Choose the original G-code from OctoPrint storage or from your device.</p>
            <p>2. Measure the height of the incomplete print on both the left and right side. Enter the lower value to the nearest 0.1 mm and choose which side measured lower.</p>
            <p>3. Build Resume G-code. The Wizard finds the layer, calculates the alignment target, and prepares a safe resume file for review.</p>
            <p>4. Safe Resume Homing gives you ways to unlock motion control and move safely over the target for realignment.</p>
            <p>5. Use relative motion commands to place the nozzle paper-test perfect on the chosen side of the incomplete print. Then select Position Calibrated, heat the nozzle, and download or resume.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="modal-footer">
            <button class="btn" type="button" data-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="contact-modal"
         class="modal hide fade"
         tabindex="-1"
         role="dialog"
         aria-labelledby="contact-modal-label"
         aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-header">
            <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-hidden="true">&times;</button>
            <h3 id="contact-modal-label">Contact</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="modal-body">
            <p>Support and activation: <a href="https://wizard.lazarus3dprint.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">wizard.lazarus3dprint.com</a></p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:failed.print.resume.wizard@proton.me">failed.print.resume.wizard@proton.me</a></p>
        </div>

        <div class="modal-footer">
            <button class="btn" type="button" data-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
